    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27491" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Mā^cra</span></b> , ae, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A river in Italy, between Liguria and Etruria</i>,
			now <i>Magra</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 5,
				7, § 48</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 39,
				32, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">40, 41,
				3</span></i>.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Macra Cōmē, Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μακρὰ κώμη</span>, <i>a town in Locris, on
				the border of Thessaly</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 32,
				13, 10</span></i>.</div>
